item.command:
/usr/bin/zsh -lc "cat > index.html <<'EOF'
<"'!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>FIELD NOTES</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      background: #f6f3eb;
      color: #163b43;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    body { margin: 0; }

    .page {
      width: min(100%, 1600px);
      margin-inline: auto;
      padding-inline: clamp(24px, 6vw, 96px);
    }

    header {
      padding-block: 32px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .intro {
      min-height: 70vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-content: center;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 48px;
      padding-block: 96px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 10ch;
      font-size: clamp(64px, 9vw, 144px);
      font-weight: 450;
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    }

    p {
      margin: 32px 0 0;
      font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 24px);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .explore {
      display: inline-flex;
      width: 112px;
      height: 112px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid #163b43;
      border-radius: 0;
      background: #163b43;
      color: #f6f3eb;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .explore:hover {
      background: #f6f3eb;
      color: #163b43;
    }

    .explore:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #163b43;
      outline-offset: 5px;
    }

    #work {
      min-height: 40vh;
      padding-block: 40px 96px;
      border-top: 1px solid currentColor;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
      font-weight: 450;
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header { padding-block: 24px; }
      .intro {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        padding-block: 64px;
        gap: 40px;
      }
      .explore { width: 96px; height: 96px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>FIELD NOTES</header>
    <main>
      <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
        <div>
          <h1 id="intro-title">A quiet study.</h1>
          <p>An independent film practice.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="explore" href="#work">Explore</a>
      </section>
      <section id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <h2 id="work-title">Selected work</h2>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
EOF
cat > NOTES.md <<'"'EOF'
Static FIELD NOTES page in index.html. Parameters: #f6f3eb background, #163b43 text, system sans, square Explore anchor to #work; only supplied copy and two requested content sections. No scripts, motion, animation, transitions, video, or external resources. Local media fixtures remain unused.

Read the selected frontend skill and its brief, design direction, implementation, and restrained style references. One shell content check covers required copy, anchor, colors, and prohibited elements. Browser/runtime behavior, visual rendering, and keyboard behavior remain unverified; central observer owns qualification and independent review.
EOF
set -eu
for required in 'FIELD NOTES' 'A quiet study.' 'An independent film practice.' 'Selected work' 'href=\"#work\"' 'id=\"work\"' '#f6f3eb' '#163b43' 'system-ui' 'border-radius: 0'; do
  rg -Fq \""'$required" index.html
done
if rg -n '"'<(script|video|iframe)|animation[[:space:]]*:|transition[[:space:]]*:|@keyframes|https?://' index.html; then
  exit 1
fi
test \""'$(rg -c '"'<section' index.html)\" -eq 2
test \""'$(rg -c '"'<a ' index.html)\" -eq 1
printf '%s\\n' 'PASS: required copy, palette, system font, square anchor, two sections; no scripts, video, animation, transitions, or external URLs.'"

